{"seq":2,"slug":"lazy-layout-internals","title":"LazyLayout 内部机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/ui/lazy-layout-internals","wordCount":676,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"lazylayout-内部机制\">LazyLayout 内部机制</h1><p><code>LazyColumn</code>、<code>LazyRow</code>、<code>LazyVerticalGrid</code> 等组件是 Compose 中使用频率最高的列表方案，但它们背后共享同一个底层基础设施——<code>LazyLayout</code> composable。理解 LazyLayout 的虚拟化机制（只组合可见项、按需回收、预取策略）不仅能帮你正确使用现有 Lazy 组件，还能让你基于 <code>LazyLayout</code> API 构建完全自定义的按需加载视图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LazyLayout 的设计思路与传统 RecyclerView 的 ViewHolder 回收池截然不同：Compose 不回收和复用组件实例，而是<strong>彻底销毁离屏组件、按需重新组合进入屏幕的组件</strong>。这种方式更简单（无 ViewType 匹配、无脏状态残留），在 Compose 的增量重组模型下性能表现优异。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;LazyLayout&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;LazyLayoutItemProvider&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;提供 item count + item content&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;LazyLayoutMeasureScope&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;根据 scroll offset 决定可见范围&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;compose 可见范围内的 item&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;measure + place 已组合的 item&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; H[&quot;LazyLayoutPrefetchStrategy&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;预取即将进入视口的 item&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"LazyLayout\"] --&gt; B[\"LazyLayoutItemProvider\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"提供 item count + item content\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"LazyLayoutMeasureScope\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"根据 scroll offset 决定可见范围\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"compose 可见范围内的 item\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"measure + place 已组合的 item\"]\n    A --&gt; H[\"LazyLayoutPrefetchStrategy\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"预取即将进入视口的 item\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件层级</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>对应类/接口</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>顶层 API</td>\n<td>面向开发者的声明式列表</td>\n<td><code>LazyColumn</code>, <code>LazyVerticalGrid</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间层</td>\n<td>管理 item 组合/回收/预取</td>\n<td><code>LazyLayout</code>, <code>LazyLayoutItemProvider</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>底层</td>\n<td>实际的子组合与布局</td>\n<td><code>SubcomposeLayout</code> + prefetch infra</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"lazylayout-api-结构\">LazyLayout API 结构</h2><p><code>LazyLayout</code> 自 Compose Foundation 1.2 起作为实验性 API 公开，让开发者能构建非标准虚拟化列表：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// LazyLayout 的签名（简化）&#10;@Composable&#10;fun LazyLayout(&#10;    itemProvider: LazyLayoutItemProvider,&#10;    modifier: Modifier = Modifier,&#10;    prefetchStrategy: LazyLayoutPrefetchStrategy? = null,&#10;    measurePolicy: LazyLayoutMeasureScope.(Constraints) -&gt; MeasureResult&#10;)&#10;&#10;// LazyLayoutItemProvider：告诉 LazyLayout &quot;有哪些 item&quot;&#10;interface LazyLayoutItemProvider {&#10;    val itemCount: Int&#10;&#10;    @Composable&#10;    fun Item(index: Int, key: Any)&#10;&#10;    fun getKey(index: Int): Any = index&#10;    fun getContentType(index: Int): Any? = null&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// LazyLayout 的签名（简化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun LazyLayout(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    itemProvider: LazyLayoutItemProvider,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    modifier: Modifier = Modifier,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    prefetchStrategy: LazyLayoutPrefetchStrategy? = null,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    measurePolicy: LazyLayoutMeasureScope.(Constraints) -> MeasureResult</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// LazyLayoutItemProvider：告诉 LazyLayout \"有哪些 item\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface LazyLayoutItemProvider {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val itemCount: Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun Item(index: Int, key: Any)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun getKey(index: Int): Any = index</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun getContentType(index: Int): Any? = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"可见范围计算\">可见范围计算</h2><p>LazyLayout 的核心决策是&quot;当前需要组合哪些 item&quot;。这个决策在 <code>measurePolicy</code> 中完成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 在 LazyLayoutMeasureScope 内：&#10;// 1. 根据滚动偏移量和视口大小计算可见范围&#10;// 2. 调用 measure(index) 对可见 item 进行组合+测量&#10;// 3. 将 Placeable 摆放到正确位置&#10;&#10;// measure(index) 的内部工作：&#10;// - 检查该 index 的 item 是否已在 SubcomposeLayout 缓存中&#10;//   - 是：直接取出 Placeable（无需重新组合）&#10;//   - 否：调用 ItemProvider.Item(index) 组合新节点，然后测量&#10;// - 超出可见范围的旧 item 被标记为&quot;不再需要&quot;&#10;//   - 立即销毁 or 保留在预取缓存中（取决于 prefetch 策略）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 LazyLayoutMeasureScope 内：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 1. 根据滚动偏移量和视口大小计算可见范围</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 2. 调用 measure(index) 对可见 item 进行组合+测量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 3. 将 Placeable 摆放到正确位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// measure(index) 的内部工作：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// - 检查该 index 的 item 是否已在 SubcomposeLayout 缓存中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//   - 是：直接取出 Placeable（无需重新组合）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//   - 否：调用 ItemProvider.Item(index) 组合新节点，然后测量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// - 超出可见范围的旧 item 被标记为\"不再需要\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//   - 立即销毁 or 保留在预取缓存中（取决于 prefetch 策略）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"item-key-与性能影响\">Item Key 与性能影响</h2><p><code>key</code> 是 LazyLayout 正确工作的关键——它决定了 item 的身份：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"LazyColumn {&#10;    items(&#10;        items = users,&#10;        key = { user -&gt; user.id }  // 稳定唯一标识&#10;    ) { user -&gt;&#10;        UserCard(user)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// key 的作用：&#10;// 1. 列表重排时复用已有的 Composition（移动而非销毁重建）&#10;// 2. rememberSaveable 的值能跟随 key 移动&#10;// 3. 动画系统能识别&quot;同一个 item 位置变了&quot;与&quot;新 item 出现了&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>LazyColumn {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    items(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        items = users,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        key = { user -> user.id }  // 稳定唯一标识</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) { user -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        UserCard(user)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// key 的作用：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 1. 列表重排时复用已有的 Composition（移动而非销毁重建）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 2. rememberSaveable 的值能跟随 key 移动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 3. 动画系统能识别\"同一个 item 位置变了\"与\"新 item 出现了\"</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>无 key（用 index）</th>\n<th>有稳定 key</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>顶部插入一项</td>\n<td>所有可见 item 重组</td>\n<td>仅新 item 组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>列表排序变化</td>\n<td>全部重组</td>\n<td>仅移动 Composition</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除中间项</td>\n<td>后续 item 重组（index 变了）</td>\n<td>仅删除对应 Composition</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item 内 remember 状态</td>\n<td>可能错乱（绑定到 index）</td>\n<td>正确跟随数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"prefetch-预取策略\">Prefetch 预取策略</h2><p>为了消除快速滚动时的&quot;白闪&quot;（item 尚未组合就已进入视口），LazyLayout 支持预取：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 默认预取策略：在即将进入视口的方向预先组合 1-2 个 item&#10;// Compose Foundation 1.7+ 的增强预取：&#10;// - 利用帧间空闲时间（类似 React 的 idle callback）做组合&#10;// - 支持嵌套预取（预取的 item 内如果有 LazyRow，也会预取其子 item）&#10;&#10;// 自定义预取策略&#10;val customPrefetch = object : LazyLayoutPrefetchStrategy {&#10;    override fun LazyLayoutPrefetchScope.onScroll(&#10;        delta: Float,&#10;        visibleIndices: IntRange,&#10;        layoutDirection: LayoutDirection&#10;    ) {&#10;        // 预取可见范围前后各 3 个 item&#10;        val prefetchRange = when {&#10;            delta &gt; 0 -&gt; visibleIndices.last + 1..visibleIndices.last + 3&#10;            else -&gt; (visibleIndices.first - 3).coerceAtLeast(0) until visibleIndices.first&#10;        }&#10;        prefetchRange.forEach { index -&gt; schedulePrefetch(index) }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 默认预取策略：在即将进入视口的方向预先组合 1-2 个 item</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Compose Foundation 1.7+ 的增强预取：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// - 利用帧间空闲时间（类似 React 的 idle callback）做组合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// - 支持嵌套预取（预取的 item 内如果有 LazyRow，也会预取其子 item）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 自定义预取策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val customPrefetch = object : LazyLayoutPrefetchStrategy {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun LazyLayoutPrefetchScope.onScroll(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        delta: Float,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        visibleIndices: IntRange,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        layoutDirection: LayoutDirection</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 预取可见范围前后各 3 个 item</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val prefetchRange = when {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            delta > 0 -> visibleIndices.last + 1..visibleIndices.last + 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            else -> (visibleIndices.first - 3).coerceAtLeast(0) until visibleIndices.first</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        prefetchRange.forEach { index -> schedulePrefetch(index) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"contenttype-优化\">ContentType 优化</h2><p><code>contentType</code> 让 LazyLayout 对同类型 item 复用 SlotTable 结构，减少组合开销：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"LazyColumn {&#10;    items(&#10;        items = feedItems,&#10;        key = { it.id },&#10;        contentType = { item -&gt;&#10;            when (item) {&#10;                is FeedItem.TextPost -&gt; &quot;text&quot;&#10;                is FeedItem.ImagePost -&gt; &quot;image&quot;&#10;                is FeedItem.VideoPost -&gt; &quot;video&quot;&#10;                is FeedItem.Ad -&gt; &quot;ad&quot;&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    ) { item -&gt;&#10;        when (item) {&#10;            is FeedItem.TextPost -&gt; TextPostCard(item)&#10;            is FeedItem.ImagePost -&gt; ImagePostCard(item)&#10;            is FeedItem.VideoPost -&gt; VideoPostCard(item)&#10;            is FeedItem.Ad -&gt; AdCard(item)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// contentType 的作用：&#10;// 当一个 type=&quot;text&quot; 的 item 离开视口后&#10;// 如果新进入的也是 type=&quot;text&quot;&#10;// 则 SubcomposeLayout 可以复用其 slot 结构&#10;// 避免完全从零组合\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>LazyColumn {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    items(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        items = feedItems,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        key = { it.id },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        contentType = { item -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            when (item) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                is FeedItem.TextPost -> \"text\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                is FeedItem.ImagePost -> \"image\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                is FeedItem.VideoPost -> \"video\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                is FeedItem.Ad -> \"ad\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) { item -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        when (item) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            is FeedItem.TextPost -> TextPostCard(item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            is FeedItem.ImagePost -> ImagePostCard(item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            is FeedItem.VideoPost -> VideoPostCard(item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            is FeedItem.Ad -> AdCard(item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// contentType 的作用：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 当一个 type=\"text\" 的 item 离开视口后</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 如果新进入的也是 type=\"text\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 则 SubcomposeLayout 可以复用其 slot 结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 避免完全从零组合</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"构建自定义虚拟化视图\">构建自定义虚拟化视图</h2><p>基于 LazyLayout 可以构建非列表的虚拟化视图，例如日历、时间线、无限画布：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun VirtualizedTimeline(&#10;    items: List&lt;TimelineEvent&gt;,&#10;    state: TimelineState = rememberTimelineState()&#10;) {&#10;    LazyLayout(&#10;        itemProvider = remember(items) {&#10;            TimelineItemProvider(items)&#10;        },&#10;        modifier = Modifier.clipToBounds()&#10;    ) { constraints -&gt;&#10;        val viewportStart = state.scrollOffset&#10;        val viewportEnd = viewportStart + constraints.maxHeight&#10;&#10;        // 根据时间轴位置计算可见的事件&#10;        val visibleItems = items.indices.filter { index -&gt;&#10;            val itemTop = items[index].timePosition&#10;            val itemBottom = itemTop + estimatedItemHeight&#10;            itemTop &lt; viewportEnd &amp;&amp; itemBottom &gt; viewportStart&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        val placeables = visibleItems.map { index -&gt;&#10;            measure(index, Constraints(maxWidth = constraints.maxWidth))&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        layout(constraints.maxWidth, constraints.maxHeight) {&#10;            visibleItems.forEachIndexed { i, index -&gt;&#10;                val y = items[index].timePosition - viewportStart&#10;                placeables[i].forEach { it.place(0, y) }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun VirtualizedTimeline(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    items: List&#x3C;TimelineEvent>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    state: TimelineState = rememberTimelineState()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    LazyLayout(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        itemProvider = remember(items) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            TimelineItemProvider(items)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = Modifier.clipToBounds()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) { constraints -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val viewportStart = state.scrollOffset</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val viewportEnd = viewportStart + constraints.maxHeight</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 根据时间轴位置计算可见的事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val visibleItems = items.indices.filter { index -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val itemTop = items[index].timePosition</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val itemBottom = itemTop + estimatedItemHeight</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            itemTop &#x3C; viewportEnd &#x26;&#x26; itemBottom > viewportStart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val placeables = visibleItems.map { index -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            measure(index, Constraints(maxWidth = constraints.maxWidth))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        layout(constraints.maxWidth, constraints.maxHeight) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            visibleItems.forEachIndexed { i, index -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val y = items[index].timePosition - viewportStart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                placeables[i].forEach { it.place(0, y) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>LazyLayout 是所有 Lazy 组件的底层基础设施，基于 SubcomposeLayout 实现按需组合</li>\n<li>与 RecyclerView 不同，Compose 不回收/复用组件实例，而是销毁离屏项、重新组合新项</li>\n<li>稳定的 <code>key</code> 是性能的第一要务——避免不必要的重组和状态错乱</li>\n<li>Prefetch 策略利用帧间空闲时间预先组合即将进入视口的 item</li>\n<li><code>contentType</code> 让同类 item 共享 slot 结构，进一步减少组合开销</li>\n<li>基于 <code>LazyLayout</code> API 可构建任意形态的虚拟化视图（时间线、日历、画布）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"custom-layout\">自定义布局</a>——Layout 协议与 MeasurePolicy 的基础知识</li>\n<li><a href=\"../advanced/performance-optimization\">性能优化实战</a>——Lazy 列表的系统化性能调优方法</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../android-development/jetpack-compose/state-management\">Android 开发基础 · 状态管理</a>——Compose 状态基础与列表中的状态保持</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LazyLayout 内部机制","id":"lazylayout-内部机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"LazyLayout API 结构","id":"lazylayout-api-结构"},{"level":2,"text":"可见范围计算","id":"可见范围计算"},{"level":2,"text":"Item Key 与性能影响","id":"item-key-与性能影响"},{"level":2,"text":"Prefetch 预取策略","id":"prefetch-预取策略"},{"level":2,"text":"ContentType 优化","id":"contenttype-优化"},{"level":2,"text":"构建自定义虚拟化视图","id":"构建自定义虚拟化视图"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"自定义布局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/ui/custom-layout"},"next":{"title":"图形与 Canvas 绘制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/ui/graphics-and-canvas"}}